"KIO::ksvn::special knows the following operations, these are made almost "
"equal in call to the current existing in KIO from kdesdk-kioslaves so, for "
"instance, &kdevelop; may use it if kdesdk-kioslaves isn't installed but uses "
"&kdesvn;::KIO::svn."
msgstr ""

